# Code owners

Changes to these areas are reviewed by the maintainers listed here in
addition to whoever else the PR assigns.

Default owner for everything not matched below:

* @parqtel/maintainers

| Path | Owner | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `/parqtel-core/src/config/**` | @parqtel/maintainers | Configuration schema and defaults are a public contract; changing one is breaking |
| `/parqtel-core/src/storage/**` | @parqtel/maintainers | On-disk format, WAL ordering contract, index durability |
| `/parqtel-core/src/wal.rs` | @parqtel/maintainers | The crash-ordering contract must be preserved — see `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` |
| `/parqtel-ingest/**` | @parqtel/maintainers | Durability of the acknowledged path |
| `/parqtel-server/src/router.rs` | @parqtel/maintainers | Routes, middleware and body limits |
| `/parqtel-server/src/ui.html` | @parqtel/maintainers | Single embedded file, no external requests |
| `/charts/**`, `/deploy/**`, `/Dockerfile`, `/docker-compose.yml` | @parqtel/maintainers | Packaging and image build |
| `/.github/workflows/**` | @parqtel/maintainers | Release gate changes affect every artifact |
| `/docs/**` | @parqtel/maintainers | Documentation accuracy |
| `/LICENSE`, `/SECURITY.md`, `/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md` | @parqtel/maintainers | Legal and policy |
| `/rules/presets/**` | @parqtel/maintainers | Embedded into the binary at compile time |
